  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Prevention of violence based on gender and economic empowerment of women, adolescents and youth in the municipality of San Nicols, Estel.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women in Nicaragua&apos;s rural communities confront gender-based violence on a daily basis and young people in these areas lack economic opportunities. Asociacin de Mujeres de Estel Xilonem (AMEX) provides training and assistance in basic human rights leadership development and access to credit. At the IAF we support community-led solutions to enhance peace and security in Nicaragua. AMEX&apos;s activities strengthen vulnerable populations so they can improve living conditions and participate equally in Nicaragua&apos;s political economic and social life.</narrative>
  </description>
